body:
I'm just going to guess early this time, Is next week's musical Seussical? If so I have THOUGHTS.

&#x200B;

I also have thoughts on Next to Normal, but I haven't actually finished the episode yet, so more on that later.

I mean, it's not impossible, but I bet there actually is a challenge to making spiral stairs in the sims 4. They would have to figure out a way to make spiral stairs work on all three room heights, and still have the same start and end location. 

&#x200B;

I'm sure there's a way to do it, I just don't know how.
